       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COND88.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-MONTH PIC 99.
       88 MONTH-JAN VALUE 1.
       88 MONTH-FEB VALUE 2.
       88 MONTH-DEC VALUE 12.
       88 QUARTER-1 VALUES 1 2 3.
       88 QUARTER-2 VALUES 4 5 6.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE 3 TO WS-MONTH.
           IF QUARTER-1 DISPLAY 'FIRST QUARTER'.
           IF MONTH-DEC DISPLAY 'LAST MONTH'.
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN MONTH-JAN DISPLAY 'JANUARY'
               WHEN MONTH-FEB DISPLAY 'FEBRUARY'
               WHEN OTHER DISPLAY 'OTHER MONTH'
           END-EVALUATE.
           STOP RUN.
